    {
      "paragraph": "sulfidation followed by alloying in situ forms Li-Ag alloy and Li₂S phases within the Li matrix. Continuous stirring ensures complete reaction, resulting in a 3D uniformly cross-linked mathrm mathrm x",
      "property_types": [
        "Chemical_Formula"
      ],
      "extracted_info": {
        "Chemical_Formula": [
          {
            "value": "Li, Li2S, Li10Ag3, Li9Ag4",
            "source_text": "the diffraction peaks at 27.0, 31.2, 44.8, 55.6, and 65.3° are assigned to the characteristic planes of Li2S JCPDS: 26-1188. Additionally, strong characteristic peaks of metallic lithium and Li-Ag alloy Li10Ag3 and Li9Ag4 phases are observed"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
